-skip(skip): This skips the specified number of documents, based on the current page. If you're on the second page and limit is 10, skip would be 10, meaning the first 10 documents are skipped,limit(limit): This limits the number of documents returned to the specified limit. If limit is 10, then only 10 documents will be returned.
